Third-party material in this directory

token/src/lib.rs
  The fungible-token example of near-sdk-rs, copied unmodified from
  https://github.com/near/near-sdk-rs at commit 1aac824cc543b2f201831f888c85396529716742
  (tag near-sdk-v5.29.0), path examples/fungible-token/ft/src/lib.rs.
  token/Cargo.toml replaces the example's workspace path dependencies with the crates.io releases
  of the same tag and copies the workspace release profile; token/Cargo.lock pins every crate.
  near-sdk-rs is licensed under MIT OR Apache-2.0 (LICENSE-MIT and LICENSE-APACHE in that
  repository).

The mutants (mutants.json) are one-line changes applied at build time to a copy of
near-contract-standards 5.29.0 taken from the local cargo registry (the crates.io release, same
licence) or to a copy of token/src/lib.rs. Neither the library source nor any wasm is stored here.
